rtant;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          La Esperanza 位于上图左上角Santa Ana区域\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          关于希望庄园和Bernadina品种\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          希望庄园位于萨尔瓦多的Santa Ana区域\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          ，属于Pacas家族，\n          <span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           Pacas家族已经是\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           五代\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           的咖啡\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           家族\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           ，Pacas品种正是由该\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           家族最早发现于其农场而得名\n          </span>\n          。希望庄园是Pacas家族于2010年11月买入，买入前它已经在种植咖啡，但由于叶锈病的影响，Pacas家族决定对它重新进行改造，维护土壤，种植新的品种。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SiaS1w8uH2v2dAfExibpXTgbUbCelQib4Dbeehu1oxDBFo4ibb1aoNQiahPib2Nu1NPZHxjf2QLhgicZCUg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 425px;height: 448px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          Bernadina这个品种最早是在家族旗下农场Los Bellotos（2009年购入）发现的，据前农场的经理讲这些树已经存在了60-70年了，Los Bellotos前农场的经理\n          <span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           Rup\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           erto\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           Bernadino\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           Merche\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n</span>\n          一直跟农场主讲他们可能是不一样的品种，它\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          的成熟总比周边其它树（波旁）更晚，它的咖啡花香也不一样，果子形状也不一样，但前庄园主觉得无所谓，于是每一年都是将这几棵树的产出和其它咖啡树混在一起处理的，直到2017年，当他再一次和新的管理者Maria来讲时，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          Maria对这5棵树非常的好奇，她决定将它们产出的咖啡果单独脱皮做处理，然后Maria就发了一些样本给她的老客户，澳洲的知名烘焙商Proud Mary，在Proud Mary烘焙后测样时它的表现让Proud Mary团队大吃一惊，它的风味喝起来让人第一反应就是这是瑰夏吧?随后，Proud Mary以25美元/磅的价格（以往最高5美元的单价已经是很高的价格了），跟Maria买了当年所有的产出，命名时为了感谢Ruperto Bernadino Merche的坚持，Maria将它命名为Bernadina\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          ；\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          随后，庄园也将该品种送往意大利的一个检测中心进行基因鉴定，结论是Bernadina有70%的瑰夏基因，另外30%的基因与埃塞的一个agaro非常相近。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SiaS1w8uH2v2dAfExibpXTgbeWAJzhDaHuxz9B21fjT9Lzm6HEhnibhia2yWsbFydbU2A0k6aSduVXUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 600px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          希望庄园于2012年\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          重新翻新土壤后，种植了包括Bernadina在内的多个品种（其余品种有红波旁Red Bourbon、帕卡玛拉Pacamara、帕卡斯Pacas、肯尼亚、摩卡Mocca、埃塞原生种等）。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SiaS1w8uH2v2dAfExibpXTgbvMEg1mDlSrCvVgNyriaQ8n1o0wg90NLzqbcgK2TuyyWPoic3joeSMmvw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;width: 425px;height: 421px;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2019年，凭借蜜处理方式的Bernadina，希望庄园赢得了当年萨尔瓦多CoE的第三名。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2021年，同样的蜜处理Bernadina，希望拿到了第8名的好成绩。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          部分资料参见下面两个参考链接：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.pdxmonthly.com/eat-and-drink/2017/09/the-incredible-tale-of-bernardina-the-super-rare-coffee-you-can-drink-in-portland-right-now\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           The Incredible Tale of Bernardina, the Super-Rare Coffee You Can Drink in Portland Right Now | Portland Monthly (pdxmonthly.com)\n          </span>\n</a>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://makercoffee.com.au/blogs/news/when-coffee-runs-through-your-veins-el-salvadors-pacas-family\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           When Coffee Runs through your Veins: A Conversation with Maria Pacas – Maker Coffee\n          </span>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 388px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
